Rākṣasa clouds rain arrows on Viṣṇu --- Viṣṇu shreds foes sesamum-wise with Śārṅga --- Viṣṇu blows dread Pāñcajanya conch --- Conch blast maddens beasts and fells warriors --- Viṣṇu arrows bleed and drop Rākṣasas like mountains --- Fleeing host turns Laṅkā-ward --- Sumālin covers Hari then loses driver and horses --- Mālin wounds Garuḍa and turns god away --- Viṣṇu beheads roaring Mālin with discus --- Grieving brothers flee while Garuḍa routs remnant